  "title": "AI Software Engineer - Junior/Mid Level",
  "fields": {
    "Zleceniodawca": "Michael Ray",
    "Opis": "We are looking for a Junior/Mid-Level AI Software Engineer with around 3 years of software development experience to help build AI-powered chatbots, applications, and automation solutions.\n\nThe ideal candidate has a solid software engineering background and hands-on experience or strong interest in modern AI technologies such as ChatGPT/OpenAI, Claude, GitHub Copilot, and AI automation tools.\n\nResponsibilities\n\n- Build and maintain AI-powered chatbots and applications.\n\n- Integrate OpenAI/ChatGPT, Claude, and other AI models into applications.\n\n- Develop APIs and backend services using Node.js, TypeScript, and Python.\n\n- Build AI agents and automation workflows for repetitive tasks and business processes.\n\n- Work with RAG, prompt engineering, embeddings, and tool/function calling.\n\n- Integrate applications with external APIs, databases, and third-party services.\n\n- Work with automation tools such as n8n, Zapier, Make, or similar platforms.\n\n- Deploy and maintain applications using AWS and/or Azure and CI/CD.\n\n- Test, debug, and improve AI features and automation workflows.\n\n- Collaborate with other developers and product team members.\n\nQualifications\n\n- Around 3 years of professional software development experience.\n\n- Experience with React, Node.js, TypeScript, and/or Python.\n\n- Some hands-on experience building AI applications, chatbots, AI agents, or automation workflows.\n\n- Familiarity with OpenAI/ChatGPT, Claude, GitHub Copilot, or similar AI technologies.\n\n- Basic understanding of LLMs, RAG, prompt engineering, and AI agents.\n\n- Experience working with REST APIs and databases.\n\n- Familiarity with AWS and/or Azure.\n\n- Familiarity with n8n, Zapier, Make, or similar automation tools is a plus.\n\n- Good debugging, problem-solving, and communication skills.\n\n- Willingness to learn and experiment with new AI technologies.\n\nHow to Apply\n\nhttps://apply.dialogkey.com/companies/dialog-key-b11b66/093855ff30",
